            "review_title": "Review at THE ROAR Restaurant & Lounge",
            "review_text": "Andee\nManila, Philippines34 contributions\n0\nFantastic for night out\nNov 2025 • Friends\nAwesome service, great ambience, good selection! Great for chill dinner with family and friends!!!! Highly recommended!!!!!!!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 26, 2025\nElyday Phú Quốc\nDear Andee,\n\nThank you so much for taking the time to share your fantastic review! We’re delighted to hear that you enjoyed our service, ambience, and food selection.\nIt truly means a lot to our team to know that your night out with friends was relaxing and memorable.\n\nYour kind words are a great encouragement to us, and we look forward to welcoming you and your loved ones back for another wonderful dining experience soon.\n\nWarm regards,\nThe ROAR Restaurant & Lounge\nRead more\nWritten November 27, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
